1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,768
Welcome to Zenith, a personalized learning platform designed to make your academic journey clear, active, and supported.

2
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:13,900
Zenith is built on three pillars.

3
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:21,500
First, Absolute Clarity: always know what to do, where to find it, and what comes next.

4
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:29,600
Second, Active Engagement and Motivation: your work is checked, your progress is recognized, and you learn at your own pace.

5
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:34,304
Third, Advice, Direction, and Community: receive personalized guidance and support without unhealthy competition.

6
00:00:36,633 --> 00:00:44,057
The Resources page provides recommended SAT and AP materials, including public self-study tracks that anyone can use.

7
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:49,400
Students can log in to access their personalized portal.

8
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:53,772
Select a course here, or return to this page whenever you need to switch subjects.

9
00:00:59,133 --> 00:01:04,200
The Roadmap displays your complete learning path.

10
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:10,500
Each item shows what is complete, available, recommended for review, or still locked.

11
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:16,261
You can also choose the roadmap view that works best for you.

12
00:01:17,843 --> 00:01:23,819
The Now page keeps things simple by showing the most important task you should work on next.

13
00:01:24,648 --> 00:01:28,900
Feedback explains how you can improve,

14
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:33,120
while your personalized Cheat Sheet preserves important concepts and lessons from previous work.

15
00:01:34,481 --> 00:01:38,000
Use Calendar to check upcoming dates,

16
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,201
and Submit to turn in your work and confirm that it was received.

17
00:01:44,017 --> 00:01:50,449
With Zenith, the process is clear, your potential is limitless. Let’s get to work.
